flowchart TD
  W[New post] --> PS[Post service → posts by author]
  PS -- PostCreated --> K{{Kafka}}
  K --> FO[Fan-out workers<br/>skip celebrities · inactive users]
  FO --> FC[(Feed cache<br/>sorted sets of post ids)]
  R[Feed request] --> FS[Feed service<br/>merge cache + celebrity posts]
  FS --> FC
  FS --> RK[Rank → hydrate<br/>posts · authors · counts · CDN media]
